# Files excluded from the Vercel upload.
#
# A .vercelignore replaces .gitignore for upload purposes, so the entries that
# keep credentials and build output out of the deployment are repeated here.
# Nothing in this list is read by `vite build` or by the serverless bridge.

# --- secrets and build output (mirrors .gitignore) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules
dist
.gev-cache
.gev-logs

# --- not needed to build or run ---
# 69 MB of markdown and media. Only *.test.mjs files read docs/CURRENT-STATE.md
# and docs/KNOWN-ISSUES.md, and unit tests do not run during `vite build`.
docs
# Pinokio launcher. Referenced only by src/pinokio*.test.mjs.
pinokio
# Puppeteer/QA fixtures and recorded audio, used by `npm test` only.
scripts/fixtures
# Local desktop launchers and QA evidence.
*.bat
*.cmd
qa-artifacts
screenshots
qa-shots
.playwright-mcp
.claude
.gstack
